            "review_title": "Review at Hangang Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Claire S\nBangkok, Thailand255 contributions\n0\nA first for me but not the last! Delicious!\nAug 2016 • Friends\nI was invited by Korean born colleages to this banquet of Korean food last week. It seemed that every 2 minutes we were served another new dish - up to 8 dishes of food. My Korean colleages explained each dish and how to eat it and that it is common to blend your dishes. \n\nThis meal was so delicious that I was craving it the next day! \n\nBreak out and try Korean especially at Hangang. The service was wonderful and I felt so at ease drizzling my food all over my placemat!!!\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2016",
