            "review_title": "Review at Hangang Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "KSiu78\nColorado Springs, Colorado46 contributions\n0\nExpensive!\nDec 2015\nOur first night in Ho Chi Minh we found this restaurant just across the street from our hotel. It looked simple but the food smelled good. There were some other customers there so we figured it was a good place. Our large group of 10 sat at the table and we were shocked at the menu prices!!! IT WAS VERY EXPENSIVE for Vietnam standards, but we were not going to get our entire group up to try to find another restaurant.... averaged about US$15 per person with no alcohol!!!\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2016",
